    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d861">

                <pb facs="0955" n="863" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg863"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/2744</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Agent at Corfu</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dodge</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Corfu</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-03T14:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 3, 1918, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 4, 9.07
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My October 16, 10 a.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d861-f1"/> your October 2,
                        noon,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d861-f2"/> regarding Bulgarian armistice. A note
                    just received from Minister of Foreign Affairs states Servian Government agrees
                    with the Government of United States and has no intention of asking for the
                    settlement of Balkan questions before final treaty of peace.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
